Pi Tool Gateway

The shell backend selection and background-task implementation originates in
mapleluvr/pi-bash-bg: https://github.com/mapleluvr/pi-bash-bg
That package declares the MIT license. This project retains the implementation
and adds the optional MXC execution gateway and session filesystem grants.

The initial public snapshot derives from development commit
01fccac996619dca642e19e4b88ce1df540de7fa. Local development history, private
runtime configuration, raw validation output and unmerged interaction work
are not part of the public snapshot.

Microsoft Execution Container resources are supplied by the optional
@microsoft/mxc-sdk dependency under its own license. Pi and TypeBox are
host-provided peer dependencies; their code is not vendored here.
